{"id":1951,"date":"2026-08-25T19:12:14","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T19:12:14","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1951"},"modified":"2026-08-25T19:43:39","modified_gmt":"2026-08-25T19:43:39","slug":"the-document-info-menu","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/info-settings\/the-document-info-menu\/","title":{"rendered":"The Document Info Menu"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Document Info Menu<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1962\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInfoMenu.webp\" alt=\"The Document Info Menu\" width=\"132\" height=\"145\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInfoMenu.webp 869w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInfoMenu-272x300.webp 272w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInfoMenu-768x847.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 132px) 100vw, 132px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Navigating through multiple ribbon tabs to find crucial document settings can slow down your workflow. To solve this, <strong>File &gt; Info<\/strong> opens a centralised hub for advanced document settings, metadata, and diagnostics. Inspired by the &#8220;Backstage View&#8221; found in industry-leading professional publishing software, this dedicated menu ensures that everything you need to prepare, protect, and finalise your document is conveniently located in one intuitive panel. Whether you are prepping a file for commercial print or securing it for private distribution, the Info menu acts as your pre-publication control centre.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">What You Can Access from File &gt; Info<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1954\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentPropertiesNew.webp\" alt=\"What You Can Access from File &gt; Info\" width=\"92\" height=\"97\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentPropertiesNew.webp 412w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentPropertiesNew-283x300.webp 283w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 92px) 100vw, 92px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Info menu houses several critical utilities for managing your file&#8217;s background data and output readiness. From this screen, you can access:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1795\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentProperties.webp\" alt=\"Document Properties\" width=\"42\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentProperties.webp 986w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentProperties-300x290.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentProperties-150x150.webp 150w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DocumentProperties-768x742.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 42px) 100vw, 42px\" \/>Document Properties &#8211;<\/strong> Define essential metadata such as Author, Company, Subject, and Keywords. This is highly recommended for keeping your files organised, improving internal searchability, and ensuring proper attribution when sharing digital copies with clients or colleagues.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1774\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector.webp\" alt=\"Document Inspector\" width=\"42\" height=\"43\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector.webp 942w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector-290x300.webp 290w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector-150x150.webp 150w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDocumentInspector-768x794.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 42px) 100vw, 42px\" \/>Document Inspector &#8211;<\/strong> Protect your privacy and clean up your workspace. This tool thoroughly scans your file to identify hidden metadata, stray off-canvas elements, and empty text boxes that you may want to purge before sharing the document publicly.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1912\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker.webp\" alt=\"Run Design Checker\" width=\"43\" height=\"51\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker.webp 808w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker-253x300.webp 253w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker-768x911.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 43px) 100vw, 43px\" \/>Run Design Checker &#8211;<\/strong> Consider this your pre-flight diagnostic scan. It reviews your layout for common publishing errors-such as unseen text overflow, low-resolution images, and objects sitting outside the printable margins-ensuring your document is flawless before exporting.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1927\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CmykCommercialPrintMode.webp\" alt=\"CMYK \/ RGB Colour Mode\" width=\"42\" height=\"44\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CmykCommercialPrintMode.webp 929w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CmykCommercialPrintMode-288x300.webp 288w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CmykCommercialPrintMode-768x799.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 42px) 100vw, 42px\" \/>CMYK \/ RGB Colour Mode &#8211;<\/strong> Easily toggle your project&#8217;s underlying colour profile depending on its final destination.<br \/>\nSwitch to CMYK for accurate ink mixing in commercial printing,<br \/>\nor use RGB for vibrant digital and web-based viewing.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1751\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToProtectADocumentV2.webp\" alt=\"Protect Document\" width=\"42\" height=\"47\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToProtectADocumentV2.webp 380w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/HowToProtectADocumentV2-268x300.webp 268w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 42px) 100vw, 42px\" \/>Protect Document &#8211;<\/strong> Secure sensitive information by applying or removing robust AES-GCM password encryption.<br \/>\nThis guarantees that only authorized individuals with the password is able to open and view your Open Publisher document.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-905\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CroppingAndCompressingImages.webp\" alt=\"Graphics Manager\" width=\"42\" height=\"44\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CroppingAndCompressingImages.webp 894w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CroppingAndCompressingImages-286x300.webp 286w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/CroppingAndCompressingImages-768x806.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 42px) 100vw, 42px\" \/>Graphics Manager &#8211;<\/strong> Open the full image asset management panel, allowing you to track, update, relink, or replace images across your entire document from a single streamlined list.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">Because these are powerful and comprehensive tools, each one has its own dedicated article in this Knowledge Base containing full, step-by-step instructions. Think of the Document Info menu as your fast, centralised launchpad giving you immediate access to all of them from one convenient place.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Document Info Menu Navigating through multiple ribbon tabs to find crucial document settings can slow down your workflow. To solve this, File &gt; Info opens a centralised hub for advanced document settings, metadata, and diagnostics. Inspired by the &#8220;Backstage View&#8221; found in industry-leading professional publishing software, this dedicated menu ensures that everything you need [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1962,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[24],"class_list":["post-1951","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-info-settings"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1951","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1951"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1951\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1966,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1951\/revisions\/1966"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1962"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1951"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1951"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}